A Docker run caps GPU memory at 8 GB. Model PixArt-Sigma-S $16\mathrm{f}\times 256^2$, 1 500 motion-rich prompts $\times$3 seeds. Variants: DPC, TA-FJLT with single-axis delta, TA-FJLT dual-axis fixed $K=6$ and TA-FJLT dual-axis analytic $K$ from $\delta=0.05$. Metrics: success rate (OOM counted), peak VRAM, fps, FVD-16, CLIP-Score, T-LPIPS, ImageBind temporal consistency and energy.  
